comment Original artwork by David Sundqvist, created for Crossfire and first released in Crossfire 0.93.3 (README dated 1997-04-24).
comment Not present in 0.93.2; added as indoor/altars/altarrugg.111 (24x24 XBM) and altarrugg.111.xpm, files dated 1997-04-15 and 1997-04-16.
comment The 0.93.3 XBM and XPM are byte-identical to the 1999-03-29 CVS import.
comment The 0.93.3 README and CHANGES credit David Sundqvist with many new images and the specialized altars.
comment Converted to PNG by mwedel in 2000, renamed to altarrugg.base.111.png at 32x32 in 2001, recompressed by akirschbaum in 2008.
comment Animation frames 112-116 added by ryo_saeba on 2007-12-07 (commit 193a1709f), built on frame 111; recompressed in 2008.
comment License from the 0.93.3 distribution, which ships the GPL v2 License file and a README notice allowing version 2 or any later version.
comment TODO: confirm ryo_saeba's frames are under the same license.
